        <mxCell id="6M56vVpiSHzf77iBxNpd-25" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Truy vấn Điểm neo:&lt;/b&gt; Hệ thống tìm trong bảng &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;43&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;LearningProgress&lt;/code&gt; để lấy &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;67&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;LastTimestamp&lt;/code&gt; (giây cuối cùng bạn xem ở lần trước).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Đồng bộ Player:&lt;/b&gt; Trình duyệt nhận dữ liệu và tự động tua Video đến đúng vị trí đó.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Kích hoạt Cảm biến:&lt;/b&gt; Hệ thống bắt đầu lắng nghe các sự kiện &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;59&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Play&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;65&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Pause&lt;/code&gt;, và &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;75&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;VisibilityChange&lt;/code&gt; (chuyển tab)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;" vertex="1">
