        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-15" edge="1" parent="1" source="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-2" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&#xa;Thu thập &amp;amp; Làm giàu dữ liệu&#xa;&#xa;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="110" y="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-16" edge="1" parent="1" source="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-3" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&#xa;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ghi nhận tương tác (Tracking):&lt;/b&gt; Mỗi khi người dùng xem bài giảng, thêm vào giỏ, hoặc tìm kiếm, Frontend bắn API gửi &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;123&quot;&gt;InteractionType&lt;/code&gt; và &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;142&quot;&gt;CourseId&lt;/code&gt; về backend. Dữ liệu được ghi vào bảng &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;189&quot;&gt;UserInteractions&lt;/code&gt;.&#xa;&#xa;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="350" x="300" y="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-17" edge="1" parent="1" source="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-4" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Tự động gắn nhãn (Tagging):&lt;/b&gt; Khi giảng viên đăng khóa học, &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;66&quot;&gt;Module Tag Extractor&lt;/b&gt; quét phần mô tả. Nếu thấy chữ &quot;C#&quot;, nó tự động chèn bản ghi vào bảng &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;156&quot;&gt;CourseTags&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;i data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ví dụ:&lt;/i&gt; Mô tả có câu &quot;Học lập trình C# căn bản&quot; &lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; data-math=&quot;\rightarrow&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;47&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-html&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot; style=&quot;height: 0.3669em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mrel&quot;&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Hệ thống tự hiểu khóa học này thuộc tag &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;99&quot;&gt;C#&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;103&quot;&gt;Programming&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="430" x="720" y="302.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-18" edge="1" parent="1" source="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-5" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Tính toán Gợi ý" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="1250" y="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-7" edge="1" parent="1" source="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-6" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&#xa;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lọc dựa trên nội dung (Content-based):&lt;/b&gt; Hệ thống tìm các khóa học có tập hợp &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;84&quot;&gt;TagId&lt;/code&gt; giao nhau (&lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; data-math=&quot;\cap&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;101&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-html&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot; style=&quot;height: 0.5556em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord&quot;&gt;∩&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;) lớn nhất với khóa học người dùng vừa xem.&#xa;&#xa;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="210" x="1450" y="315" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-10" edge="1" parent="1" source="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-6" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-9" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-6" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lọc cộng tác (Collaborative Filtering):&lt;/b&gt; Hệ thống tìm các &quot;linh hồn đồng điệu&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Nếu User A và User B đều mua khóa &lt;i data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;34&quot;&gt;SQL Server&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,1,1,0&quot;&gt;User A mua thêm khóa &lt;i data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;ASP.NET MVC&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,1,2,0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; data-math=&quot;\rightarrow&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot; style=&quot;height: 0.3669em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mrel&quot;&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Hệ thống đánh dấu khóa &lt;i data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,1,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;35&quot;&gt;ASP.NET MVC&lt;/i&gt; là mục tiêu tiềm năng cho User B.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="390" x="1735" y="285" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-19" edge="1" parent="1" source="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-9" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-11" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-9" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&#xa;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Loại trừ khóa học đã sở hữu:&lt;/b&gt; Truy vấn bảng &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;51&quot;&gt;Enrollments&lt;/code&gt;. Nếu &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;68&quot;&gt;UserId&lt;/code&gt; đã có khóa X ở trạng thái &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;101&quot;&gt;Active&lt;/code&gt;, khóa X bị gạch tên khỏi danh sách gợi ý.&#xa;&#xa;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="240" x="1810" y="510" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-20" edge="1" parent="1" source="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-11" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-12" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-11" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Loại trừ giỏ hàng hiện tại:&lt;/b&gt; Nếu khóa Y đang nằm trong giỏ (Cart), hệ thống cũng loại bỏ để tránh việc gợi ý lại chính cái họ đang định mua." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="250" x="1810" y="670" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-21" edge="1" parent="1" source="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-12" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-13">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-12" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&#xa;Phân phối &amp;amp; Hiển thị&#xa;&#xa;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="1870" y="810" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-22" edge="1" parent="1" source="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-13" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-14" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-13" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;API Response:&lt;/b&gt; Backend đóng gói danh sách thành mảng JSON. Để tăng tốc, kết quả này thường được lưu tạm (Cache) trong &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;139&quot;&gt;Redis&lt;/b&gt; khoảng 5-10 phút để không phải tính lại liên tục.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="330" x="1400" y="795" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-kbKJtPAx45ZO1PkwD9-14" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Vue.js nhận JSON và đổ dữ liệu vào các Component động như Carousel &quot;Khóa học dành cho bạn&quot; hoặc Sidebar &quot;Người khác cũng mua&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="230" x="1100" y="810" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
